### ===== 2FA =====

### Start TOTP setup (returns QR + secret)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/2fa/totp/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verify TOTP setup (paste 6-digit code from Authenticator)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/2fa/totp/verify-setup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "123456"
}

### Verify TOTP login (after login returns twoFactorRequired)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/2fa/totp/verify-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "PASTE_USER_ID_FROM_LOGIN_RESPONSE",
  "token": "123456"
}

### Request email OTP
POST http://localhost:4000/api/2fa/email/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Verify email OTP
POST http://localhost:4000/api/2fa/email/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "code": "662628"
}